            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagadiyuuseedá' Saulo guna kángw beér adoodá' Daudi ira axweés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo iri oó', «Daudi kaangwí bawaak, ‹Gár waawutmo i slai kitángw gwaduú dasiirose a tuumboó hhawaataá tsiiruú wák awa Filisti, as li/ayduú wakuusér waawutmo nguwa bui.› » Adoorí an adoodá' Saulo aa qoomeés as kahhó' Daudi kuwa gaasi nee múk Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sagadiyuusér Saulo kangwdá' kuwa alki/iít dír Daudi, Daudi iri qwalaá/, gari tsaáhh daxta adór dasír waawutmo ngir duúx. Dír duuxo ira xeeriiká, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nee mukós tana tláy, hhawaataá múk Filisti awa tsiire tsár kingiri tsuú/, Daudi tumbáy'ín nguri huúw ay dír waawutmo Saulo. Tumbáydá' guri wakeetín faarooro, nguwa hanmisi dír waawutmo Saulo, as kahhó' tawa hhawaatuú dasír waawutmo. Saulo dasiirós tidá' ta bay Mikali gari haniís dír Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ngiwa ár gari tsaáhh, adór Daudi nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tar dinkwa, nee adór dasiirós Mikali Daudi ngur sla'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo Daudi guri ló'wa da'ayuút, iri wakusmowós tleehhiít qooma sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slaqwaruusér Filisti iri slaqwarár eér amór múk Israeli, ala umuúqo qoomár tawa slaqwi, Daudi in baalaalín, sagadiyuusér Saulo ba/a, gawaá adoorihe umuú Daudi iri iia tleerúy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
